[size=6][b]ProductionViewer [/b][/size]
[size=6][b]A Factory Production Dashboard for StarRupture[/b][/size]

Track everything your factories produce and consume with a live, searchable production dashboard.

[b]Client-side only[/b]

[line]

[size=5][b]Support[/b][/size]

[b]Found a bug?[/b] Report it on [url=https://github.com/AlienXAXS/StarRupture-Plugin-ProductionViewer/issues]GitHub[/url] and attach your [b]ModLoader.log[/b] (in [b]Binaries\Win64\ModLoader\Logs\[/b]).

[quote][b]If you have a question or want to discuss the mod, please join our [url=https://discord.gg/G5a4GYsvrz]Discord[/url].[/b][/quote]

[line]

[size=5][b]What It Does[/b][/size]

ProductionViewer adds a dedicated production statistics window that tracks item production and consumption across your entire factory network.

Open the dashboard at any time using the configured hotkey (default: [b]P[/b]) to view detailed production metrics, trends, and historical data.

[line]

[size=5][b]Features[/b][/size]

[list]
[*]Separate Production and Consumption views[/*]
[*]Live graphs showing production rates over time[/*]
[*]One graph line per item, scaled for easy comparison[/*]
[*]Search and filter items by name[/*]
[*]Hover items to highlight them on the graph[/*]
[*]Per-item totals and production rates per minute[/*]
[*]Built-in item icons for easier identification, copied the first time they are shown rather than all at launch[/*]
[/list]
[b]Time Ranges[/b]

[list]
[*]5 Seconds[/*]
[*]1 Minute[/*]
[*]10 Minutes[/*]
[*]1 Hour[/*]
[*]All Time[/*]
[/list]
[b]Factory Coverage

Production is tracked from both nearby factories and distant mass-simulated factories, allowing accurate statistics across your entire base.
[/b]
[line]
[b]
[size=5][b]Persistence[/b][/size]

All Time statistics are automatically saved and restored when loading a save game.

This allows long-term production totals to persist between play sessions.

Short-term history windows (5s, 1m, 10m, and 1h) are intentionally reset each time the game starts.
[/b]
[line]
[b]
[size=5][b]Installation[/b][/size]
[/b]
[list=1]
[*][b]Download the latest file from the [b]Files[/b] tab[/b][/*]
[*][b]Open the ZIP file[/b][/*]
[*][b]Copy the contents of the included Plugins folder into:
[i]"StarRupture\Binaries\Win64\ ModLoader\ Plugins"[/i][/b][/*]
[*][b]Launch the game[/b][/*]
[*][b]Press [b]P[/b] (default) to open the Production Viewer[/b][/*]
[/list]
[line]
[b]
[size=5][b]Configuration[/b][/size]

Config file:
[i]"Plugins\config\ProductionViewer.ini"[/i]
[/b]
[list]
[*][b]Enabled — enable or disable the plugin[/b][/*]
[*][b]ToggleKey — key used to open and close the dashboard (default: P)[/b][/*]
[/list][b]
The hotkey can also be changed through the ModLoader keybind settings.
[/b]
[line]
[b]
[size=5][b]Troubleshooting[/b][/size]
[/b]
[list]
[*][b][b]Dashboard does not appear[/b] — ensure the plugin is enabled and press the configured hotkey[/b][/*]
[*][b][b]No production data visible[/b] — allow the game to run for a short period so statistics can be collected[/b][/*]
[*][b][b]Plugin not loading[/b] — check [i]"modloader.log in Binaries\Win64"[/i][/b][/*]
[/list]

